            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - Public Limited Company in Delhi Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>Public Ltd = S.2(71) Companies Act 2013. Min 7 shareholders + 3 directors. Shares freely transferable. Can issue prospectus + IPO on BSE/NSE. Name ends 'Limited'. RoC Delhi IFCI Tower Nehru Place. From Rs 50,000. 15-20 days. AGM within 6 months FY. 4 board meetings/year. Statutory audit mandatory. CP financial services + Aerocity infra + Okhla mfg IPO + Nehru Place pre-IPO tech. No PT Delhi.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Delhi's Public Limited Company ecosystem spans financial services, infrastructure, and manufacturing. For a comprehensive overview, see our <a href="/public-company-registration">Public Limited Company Registration</a> national guide.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Governing</td><td>S.2(71) Companies Act 2013. Shares freely transferable. Can issue prospectus for public subscription</td></tr><tr><td>Members</td><td>Min 7 shareholders (no max) + min 3 directors (1 resident Indian). Name ends "Limited"</td></tr><tr><td>IPO Capability</td><td>Only structure for BSE/NSE listing. DRHP via SEBI ICDR 2018. NCD issuance. QIB investment</td></tr><tr><td>Cost</td><td>From Rs 50,000 (3+ DSCs + MCA fees + MOA/AOA + professional). Annual compliance highest</td></tr><tr><td>Authority</td><td>RoC Delhi, IFCI Tower, 61 Nehru Place, New Delhi 110019. SPICe+ via MCA21</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p</p>
                <p>CP financial services/NBFC (QIB investment, listed NCDs). Aerocity aviation/infra/hospitality (AAI concessions, project bonds). Okhla manufacturing IPO (BSE SME / NSE Emerge). Nehru Place pre-IPO tech (walking distance to RoC Delhi). Real estate RERA Delhi (NCD + REIT). 4 board meetings/year. AGM by 30 Sept. SEBI LODR if listed. 1/3 independent directors. No PT Delhi. Patron Rohini = registration to IPO readiness.</p>
