        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1-2</span><h3 class="step-title">Name + Capital + DSC/DIN</h3><p class="step-description">Name ending "Limited" - cross-check MCA21 + BSE/NSE listed entities. Define objects clause + authorized capital. Reserve via SPICe+ Part A (Rs 1,000, valid 20 days). DSC Class 3 for 3+ directors (Aadhaar eKYC same day). At least 1 resident Indian director (182+ days). DIN auto-issued via SPICe+.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Name reserved</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>DSCs ready</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="40" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="800" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">PLC</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Ready</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3-4</span><h3 class="step-title">MOA/AOA + SPICe+ Filing</h3><p class="step-description">CS team drafts e-MOA (INC-33) + e-AOA (INC-34) for public company governance. Collect INC-9, DIR-2, DIR-8 from all directors. ID/address for 7+ shareholders. SPICe+ (INC-32 + AGILE-PRO-S) filed with RoC Delhi at IFCI Tower. Delhi stamp duty on MOA/AOA (moderate vs Maharashtra).</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Drafted</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Filed</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="15" width="80" height="50" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="40" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">MCA</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">SPICe+</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5-6</span><h3 class="step-title">COI + Post-Incorporation + IPO Prep</h3><p class="step-description">RoC Delhi issues COI with CIN/PAN/TAN (15-20 days). INC-20A within 180 days. First board meeting within 30 days (S.173). Auditor (ADT-1) within 30 days (S.139). If planning IPO: appoint SEBI Merchant Banker, commence 3-year audit track, plan capital structure per SEBI ICDR 2018. AGM within 6 months FY.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Incorporated</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>IPO-ready path</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="60" rx="8" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M52 40l5 5 12-12" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Listed Path</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>

